"[energetically] Hold up, hold up — I need every man in this room locked in right now. ${S} is about to walk out here, and let me put this in perspective. [triumphantly] We're talking about a feature performer. A headliner. Somebody who's earned every accolade she's got and then some. [excitedly] If you're not at the rail in ten seconds, that's a mistake. Catch her after the show — and follow her work. Right now... the incomparable... ${S}."

