"Okay, I see you. I see all of y'all. And I got something for you right now. ${S} is coming to the main stage — and if you're not paying attention, that's on you. The lovely ${S}."
"All eyes front — and I mean all of them. ${S} is heading your way. I don't care what you were doing, what you were thinking — none of that matters in about three seconds. ${S}."
